From 9b098a405addeb006904be45cdfaa733f80cb55f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FreeholdOS Build <build@freeholdos.local>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:38:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compartments: add location, the place of an app, the persona

The policy store is version 2: a location class (real, substituted or blocked) and, for an Isolated app, the place of its persona. The service reads the place data of the image once, writes the persona file next to the sensor file, takes the location permissions of an app whose location is blocked or whose persona cannot be made, offers the persona to the other services of this process (CompartmentsInternal), and tells the sensor service what the phone is doing from the speed of the real fixes that pass the passive provider (ADR-208).
